Remove submodule:

rm ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER}/.git
mv ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER} tmp
git submodule deinit ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER}
git rm ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER}
mv tmp ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER}
git add ${SUBMODULE_FOLDER}

Add multiple push url to remote:

git remote set-url --add --push origin <url1>
git remote set-url --add --push origin <url2>

(add ALL intended push urls here, since the first command will overwrite the
default push url)

Remove a push url from remote:

git remote set-url --delete --push origin <url>
